This license covers the original code and procedural assets in this
repository (everything under src/, the procedural car bodies, terrain,
road/fence geometry, and the from-scratch audio synthesizer). It does NOT
cover the handful of downloaded third-party models/textures used for the
Ultra Graphics cars, trees, and water ripple detail -- those keep their own
licenses (several are CC BY 4.0, one tier is CC BY-NC-SA 4.0/non-commercial).
See the in-game Credits screen (Settings is not required; Main Menu >
Credits) or README.md's Credits section for the full, current list with
sources and exact license per asset.
